Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: arm: sunxi: Add Anbernic RG34XX SP

The Anbernic RG34XX SP is an Allwinner H700 clamshell handheld based on
the RG35XX SP, with two analog sticks and stick-click buttons added.
Add its compatible.

This patch was drafted with an AI coding assistant (Claude) and checked
with dt_binding_check.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml
index 28437c47ac..f7a6aab62c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml
@@ -56,6 +56,11 @@ properties:
           - const: anbernic,rg-nano
           - const: allwinner,sun8i-v3s
 
+      - description: Anbernic RG34XX SP
+        items:
+          - const: anbernic,rg34xx-sp
+          - const: allwinner,sun50i-h700
+
       - description: Anbernic RG35XX (2024)
         items:
           - const: anbernic,rg35xx-2024
